---
// Poesia.astro - Dedicated poetry section for Piedad Morales ("Des Hojada Palabra")
// Based on the Stitch Design System "Tierra de Palabras"
import { asset } from "../utils/paths";
---

<section 
  id="poesia" 
  class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 bg-background relative overflow-hidden border-t border-outline-variant/40"
>
  <!-- Running Stitch Decoration at Top and Bottom -->
  <div class="stitch-line absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 opacity-40"></div>
  <div class="stitch-line absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 opacity-40"></div>

  <!-- Ambient Organic Watermark Background Blobs -->
  <div 
    class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed/25 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div 
    class="absolute top-1/2 -right-36 w-[450px] h-[450px] rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div 
    class="absolute -bottom-24 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed/25 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header with Editorial Voice -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14 sm:mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed-variant px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-terracotta/20 shadow-xs">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">auto_stories</span>
        <span>Capítulo Poético • Archivo Vivo</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-terracotta tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
        Des Hojada Palabra: <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="italic text-ochre font-serif">El Canto que no se Apaga</span>
      </h2>

      <!-- Monospace Poetic Inscription -->
      <div class="mt-6 font-poetry text-sm sm:text-base text-charcoal bg-paper-grain p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-terracotta paper-shadow relative colouring-fill">
        <p class="italic">
          «Como hilo rojo que zurce el tiempo, la memoria se niega a ser silencio. En cada puntada, un nombre. En cada verso, un hogar.»
        </p>
        <span class="block text-right text-xs font-sans font-semibold text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">
          — Piedad Morales, <cite class="normal-case">Des Hojada Palabra</cite>
        </span>
      </div>

      <p class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg text-on-surface-variant mt-6 leading-relaxed">
        La lírica de Piedad Morales brota del barro ribereño del Magdalena y el latido convulso de la ciudad. Su poesía no es un artificio quieto, sino una trinchera de ternura, un conjuro contra el olvido y una ofrenda de sororidad tejida a mano.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <!-- 1. FEATURED AUDIOVISUAL ARCHIVE: VIDEO PLAYER SECTION             -->
    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <div class="mb-20 sm:mb-28">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/60 paper-shadow relative overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- Subtle Top Stitch Line -->
        <div class="stitch-line absolute top-0 left-6 right-6 opacity-30"></div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
          
          <!-- Left Column (lg:col-span-7): Video Player Frame -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-7">
            <div class="relative group">
              
              <!-- Handcrafted cross-stitch detailing at Corners -->
              <div class="absolute -top-3 -left-3 z-20 flex items-center gap-1 text-ochre select-none pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg rotate-45">close</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg rotate-45">close</span>
              </div>
              <div class="absolute -bottom-3 -right-3 z-20 flex items-center gap-1 text-ochre select-none pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg rotate-45">close</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg rotate-45">close</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Main Frame with Rag-Doll Border & Tactile Slant -->
              <div class="rag-doll-border bg-surface-container-highest p-3 sm:p-4 paper-shadow transform -rotate-0.5 group-hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500 bg-paper-grain">
                
                <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-charcoal aspect-video shadow-inner">
                  
                  <!-- HTML5 Video Element -->
                  <video 
                    id="poesia-video-player"
                    class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                    preload="metadata"
                    playsinline
                    aria-label="Registro audiovisual y recital de Piedad Morales"
                  >
                    <source src={asset("/videos/video6.mp4")} type="video/mp4" />
                    Tu navegador no soporta la reproducción de video HTML5.
                  </video>

                  <!-- Top Pill Badge Over Video -->
                  <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 z-20 pointer-events-none">
                    <span class="bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-md text-terracotta text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-outline-variant/40 shadow-xs flex items-center gap-1.5">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-terracotta">videocam</span>
                      <span>Archivo Audiovisual • Registro Vivo</span>
                    </span>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Central Big Play Button Overlay -->
                  <div 
                    id="video-play-overlay" 
                    class="absolute inset-0 bg-charcoal/40 flex items-center justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 z-10 cursor-pointer group/btn"
                  >
                    <button 
                      type="button" 
                      id="video-big-play-btn"
                      class="w-18 h-18 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-terracotta text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center shadow-xl hover:scale-110 active:scale-95 transition-transform duration-300 border-2 border-surface"
                      aria-label="Reproducir video de Piedad Morales"
                    >
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl sm:text-5xl ml-1">play_arrow</span>
                    </button>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Custom Interactive Video Bar at Bottom -->
                  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-3 bg-gradient-to-t from-charcoal/90 via-charcoal/60 to-transparent z-20 flex flex-col gap-2">
                    
                    <!-- Progress Bar -->
                    <div class="w-full h-1.5 bg-surface/30 hover:h-2.5 rounded-full cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden transition-all" id="video-progress-container">
                      <div id="video-progress-bar" class="h-full bg-secondary-container rounded-full w-0 transition-all duration-100"></div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Bottom Controls Row -->
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-surface text-xs font-mono">
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <button 
                          type="button" 
                          id="video-toggle-play" 
                          class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors p-1"
                          aria-label="Reproducir o Pausar"
                        >
                          <span id="play-icon" class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">play_arrow</span>
                        </button>
                        <button 
                          type="button" 
                          id="video-toggle-mute" 
                          class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors p-1"
                          aria-label="Silenciar o Activar sonido"
                        >
                          <span id="mute-icon" class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">volume_up</span>
                        </button>
                        <span id="video-time-display" class="text-[11px] select-none text-surface/80">00:00 / 00:00</span>
                      </div>

                      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <button 
                          type="button" 
                          id="video-toggle-fullscreen" 
                          class="hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors p-1"
                          aria-label="Pantalla completa"
                        >
                          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">fullscreen</span>
                        </button>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                  </div>

                </div>

                <!-- Frame Footnote -->
                <div class="mt-3 px-2 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-ochre font-bold">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">mic</span>
                    <span>Voz, Imagen y Presencia</span>
                  </span>
                  <span>Colección Audiovisual • Archivo Piedad Morales</span>
                </div>

              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right Column (lg:col-span-5): Curatorial Text & Narrative Context -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-center space-y-6">
            
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ochre">
                Memoria Encarnada
              </span>
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-terracotta leading-tight">
                Las Trincheras de Papel y la Palabra Viva
              </h3>
            </div>

            <p class="font-body text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Más allá de la página impresa, Piedad Morales creía en la palabra dicha en voz alta: la poesía que resuena en las esquinas, en los pabellones de salud, en las marchas de mujeres vestidas de negro y en las plazas populares.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface-container-lowest p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-terracotta/15 flex items-center justify-center text-terracotta flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">newspaper</span>
                </span>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-charcoal">Revista «Nuestro Espacio»</h4>
                  <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">
                    Cofundadora y editora de este refugio impreso para el ensayo crítico, la lírica libre y las voces marginadas de Antioquia.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-surface-container-lowest p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-feminist-purple/15 flex items-center justify-center text-feminist-purple flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">campaign</span>
                </span>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-charcoal">Pliego «Las Cigarras»</h4>
                  <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">
                    Espacio editorial feminista donde sus proclamas poéticas interpelaron la guerra cotidiana y celebraron la autonomía femenina.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <a 
                href="#antologia-selecta" 
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-ochre text-on-primary font-body text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-secondary-container hover:text-on-secondary-container transition-all shadow-sm"
              >
                <span>Leer Poemas en la Antología</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">south</span>
              </a>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <!-- 2. PUBLISHED WORKS: TRILOGY & COLLECTIONS SHOWCASE               -->
    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <div class="mb-20 sm:mb-28">
      
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between mb-10 pb-4 border-b border-outline-variant/60 gap-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ochre bg-secondary-fixed/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-ochre/20">
            Bibliografía Esencial
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-terracotta mt-2 tracking-tight">
            Colecciones y Poemarios
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant max-w-md">
          Cuatro estaciones creativas que marcan la madurez lírica de Piedad, desde la sospecha inicial hasta el despojo luminoso de la palabra.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Book Cards Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
        
        <!-- Book 1: Indicio Inquietante (1993) -->
        <article class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-28 h-28 rounded-full bg-ochre/10 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></div>

          <div>
            <!-- Book Spine Header -->
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-ochre bg-secondary-fixed/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md">
                1993
              </span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant/80">
                Colección Inicial
              </span>
            </div>

            <!-- Faux Book Cover Graphic -->
            <div class="h-44 w-full bg-surface-container-highest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/40 mb-4 p-4 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden paper-shadow bg-paper-grain group-hover:border-ochre/50 transition-colors">
              <div class="stitch-line w-full opacity-30"></div>
              <div class="text-center my-auto">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-ochre text-3xl opacity-70 mb-1 block">auto_awesome</span>
                <p class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-terracotta leading-snug">Indicio Inquietante</p>
                <p class="font-body text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant italic mt-0.5">Piedad Morales</p>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right text-[9px] font-mono text-on-surface-variant">Medellín • Ed. Marginal</div>
            </div>

            <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-charcoal mb-2">
              Indicio Inquietante
            </h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Primer poemario publicado. Indaga sobre los temblores íntimos de la mujer, el amor insumiso y el enigma del río que acompaña su memoria de infancia.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-outline-variant/40 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ochre font-semibold">
            <span>Tono: Revelación</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">bookmark</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Book 2: Lluvia en la Memoria (2003) -->
        <article class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-28 h-28 rounded-full bg-feminist-purple/10 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></div>

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-feminist-purple bg-tertiary-fixed px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md">
                2003
              </span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant/80">
                Poesía del Recuerdo
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="h-44 w-full bg-surface-container-highest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/40 mb-4 p-4 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden paper-shadow bg-paper-grain group-hover:border-feminist-purple/50 transition-colors">
              <div class="stitch-line w-full opacity-30"></div>
              <div class="text-center my-auto">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-feminist-purple text-3xl opacity-70 mb-1 block">water_drop</span>
                <p class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-feminist-purple leading-snug">Lluvia en la Memoria</p>
                <p class="font-body text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant italic mt-0.5">Piedad Morales</p>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right text-[9px] font-mono text-on-surface-variant">Colección Lilas</div>
            </div>

            <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-charcoal mb-2">
              Lluvia en la Memoria
            </h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Consolidación de su voz pacifista y comunitaria. El agua limpia el dolor de la violencia y nombra la añoranza de quienes ya no están en las orillas.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-outline-variant/40 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-feminist-purple font-semibold">
            <span>Tono: Duelo & Esperanza</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">bookmark</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Book 3: Des Hojada Palabra (2006) - Highlighted Feature -->
        <article class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-terracotta paper-shadow hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden bg-primary-fixed/15">
          <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-28 h-28 rounded-full bg-terracotta/15 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></div>
          
          <div class="absolute top-3 right-3">
            <span class="bg-terracotta text-on-primary text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow-xs">
              Obra Central
            </span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-terracotta bg-primary-fixed px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md">
                2006
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="h-44 w-full bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border border-terracotta/40 mb-4 p-4 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden paper-shadow bg-paper-grain">
              <div class="stitch-line w-full opacity-60"></div>
              <div class="text-center my-auto">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-terracotta text-3xl opacity-80 mb-1 block">draw</span>
                <p class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-terracotta leading-snug">Des Hojada Palabra</p>
                <p class="font-body text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant italic mt-0.5">Piedad Morales</p>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right text-[9px] font-mono text-terracotta font-semibold">Antología Cumbre</div>
            </div>

            <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-terracotta mb-2">
              Des Hojada Palabra
            </h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Su manifiesto lírico definitivo. El juego deliberado con el despojo («des-hojada») expone la fragilidad desnuda de la vida y la fuerza indestructible de la ternura.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-terracotta/30 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-terracotta font-bold">
            <span>Tono: Resistencia Visceral</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">star</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Book 4: Sortilegio de azares (2000 - 2012) -->
        <article class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/50 paper-shadow hover:-translate-y-1.5 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute -right-8 -top-8 w-28 h-28 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/20 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></div>

          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-ochre bg-secondary-fixed/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md">
                2000 — 2012
              </span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant/80">
                Edición Revisada
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="h-44 w-full bg-surface-container-highest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/40 mb-4 p-4 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden paper-shadow bg-paper-grain group-hover:border-ochre/50 transition-colors">
              <div class="stitch-line w-full opacity-30"></div>
              <div class="text-center my-auto">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-ochre text-3xl opacity-70 mb-1 block">magic_button</span>
                <p class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ochre leading-snug">Sortilegio de azares</p>
                <p class="font-body text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant italic mt-0.5">Piedad Morales</p>
              </div>
              <div class="text-right text-[9px] font-mono text-on-surface-variant">Edición Póstuma y Viva</div>
            </div>

            <h4 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-charcoal mb-2">
              Sortilegio de azares
            </h4>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              El encantamiento de lo cotidiano, el juego de dados de la existencia y la celebración del amor sin ataduras. Un compendio de poemas breves y talismanes verbales.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-outline-variant/40 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ochre font-semibold">
            <span>Tono: Mística & Libertad</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">bookmark</span>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>

    </div>


    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <!-- 3. INTERACTIVE ANTHOLOGY: SELECTED POEMS (TYPEWRITER ARCHIVE)    -->
    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <div id="antologia-selecta" class="scroll-mt-24">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-feminist-purple/15 flex items-center justify-center text-feminist-purple">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">menu_book</span>
        </span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-charcoal">
            Antología Selecta: Hojas de Máquina de Escribir
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs font-body text-on-surface-variant">
            Haz clic en cada poema para leer las estrofas originales o copiar el verso a tu libreta.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Interactive Accordion Container -->
      <div class="space-y-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto" id="poemas-accordion">
        
        <!-- Poem 1: Nosotros -->
        <div class="accordion-item bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/60 paper-shadow overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300">
          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="accordion-trigger w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between text-left hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors group cursor-pointer"
            aria-expanded="false"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-terracotta bg-primary-fixed px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">01</span>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-display text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-charcoal group-hover:text-terracotta transition-colors">
                  Nosotros
                </h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-body">Sobre los márgenes, el río y la memoria insumisa</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-hover:text-terracotta transform transition-transform duration-300 accordion-arrow">
              expand_more
            </span>
          </button>

          <div class="accordion-panel hidden px-6 pb-6 pt-2 bg-paper-grain border-t border-dashed border-outline-variant/60">
            <div class="relative py-4 pl-6 border-l-3 border-terracotta font-poetry text-charcoal text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line">
              <p>Nosotros,
los que habitamos el margen,
no pedimos permiso para sangrar la tinta.

Nuestra voz es el río que se desborda,
la memoria que no se seca al sol.

En cada orilla sembramos un nombre,
en cada piedra una promesa:
no seremos el eco del verdugo,
seremos el canto que reconstruye la casa.</p>
            </div>
            
